<h4>C. Dialogue with Fulton Sheen</h4>
<p>Imagine you can talk with Venerable Fulton Sheen. He tells you that you have a God-shaped hole in your soul. Write a brief dialogue (10-12 lines) between you and him. What do you ask him? What does he answer? What objections do you raise? How does the conversation end?</p>
