<h4>D. The Thirst Journal</h4>
<p>Keep a small journal this week. Each night, write down:</p>
<ul>
<li>What did I seek most today? (approval, fun, rest, achievement...?)</li>
<li>Did it leave me satisfied, or hungrier?</li>
<li>Was there any moment when I felt peace, even briefly? Describe it.</li>
</ul>
<p>At the end of the week, read your whole journal and write a reflection: What pattern do you see? What direction does your deepest desire point toward?</p>
