<h3>4. Verse to Memorize</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>&laquo;You have made us for yourself, O Lord, and our heart is restless until it rests in you.&raquo;</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; St. Augustine, Confessions I,1 (quoted in CCC 30)</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Going deeper:</strong> Also read Psalm 63 (&laquo;O God, you are my God, I seek you, my soul thirsts for you&raquo;) and memorize verse 2. Write the verse here when you have it ready:</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
