<section class="content">

<h3>5. Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord, I thank you because you made me for yourself.<br />
I recognize that sometimes I fill my heart with things that don't satisfy me.<br />
Help me recognize my deepest desire,<br />
and not be afraid to seek your face.<br />
You who are living water, quench my thirst.<br />
Give me the courage to leave that space in my soul free<br />
&mdash;the space that only you can fill.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

<p><strong>Silent prayer practice:</strong> This week, find 5 minutes a day to sit in silence. You don't have to say anything. Just sit and tell God: &laquo;Here I am.&raquo; Listen. At the end of the week, write: What happened in those minutes of silence? Was it easy or hard? Did you feel anything?</p>
