<section class="content">

<h3>6. Commitment for the Week</h3>

<p>Choose <strong>at least one concrete commitment</strong> to live out this week. Check the one you choose:</p>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> This week I will identify every time I feel that &laquo;hole&raquo; or inner emptiness and, instead of immediately filling it with my phone, food, or any distraction, I will pause for 30 seconds and say: &laquo;Jesus, this space is for you.&raquo;</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will ask someone close to me (a friend, a family member, a classmate): &laquo;Do you believe in God? Why or why not?&raquo; and I will truly listen to their answer, without judging or interrupting.</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will do the &laquo;Thirst Journal&raquo; (Activity D) for at least 5 days. Writing even one line each night.</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will pray Psalm 63 aloud twice this week, and the second time I will read it as if every word were my own.</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will visit a church or chapel for even 10 minutes, outside of Mass. Just to be there, in silence, unhurried.</p>
</div>

<p><em>My personal commitment (write it in your own words if you want something different):</em></p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin-top:16px">At the end of the week, review: Did I keep my commitment? What changed in me by doing it? If I didn't keep it, what got in the way?</p>
